'''Greenland''' is the 32nd stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[B.B.Bunny]] is introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], in Chapter 2, [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]] is unlocked on this stage.

