==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For all Chapters: When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], start spamming meatshields, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]]. They will need to be spammed throughout the whole battle. You won't even need to upgrade your [[Worker Cat]]. If your cats are upgraded enough, you should win this battle very easily. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] if you need extra support against Sir Seal.

This stage can also be cheesed easily. Just spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] and use them to rush down the enemy base.

