==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, this stage takes place in '''Niigata Prefecture'''.
*From production to flavor, Niigata is known as the premier prefecture for ''[[wikipedia:Koshihikari|koshihikari]]'' rice, as indicated by the enemy base.

